# Build context excludes for `container build` (Containerfile). Apple's
# container(1) builds with BuildKit under the hood, which reads .dockerignore.
#
# Patterns MUST be `**/`-prefixed: a bare `node_modules` matches only the repo
# root, which silently left ~490 MB of web/frontend/{dist,node_modules,dist-ssr}
# and web/.wrangler in the context and stalled the build for 20 minutes. With
# these, the context is ~85 MB — essentially just the tracked files.
**/node_modules
**/.wrangler
**/dist
**/dist-ssr
.git
.claude
test-results
playwright-report

# Secrets — passed in at build time as --build-arg instead, never COPYed.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
**/.dev.vars
